@startuml
title Classes: the documents, and the tables beneath them
hide empty methods
left to right direction

package "What people read" {
  class "room:<name>" as RoomDoc <<document>> {
    name
    members
    messages
  }
  class "session" as SessionDoc <<document>> {
    name
    room
  }
  class "lobby" as LobbyDoc <<document>> {
    rooms
  }
  class Message {
    author
    text
    at
  }
}

package "What is stored" {
  class rooms <<table>> {
    name
  }
  class messages <<table>> {
    room
    author
    text
    at
  }
  class sessions <<table>> {
    name
    room
  }
}

RoomDoc *-- "0..*" Message : messages
SessionDoc ..> RoomDoc : room names one >
LobbyDoc ..> RoomDoc : lists the ones with people in >

RoomDoc *-- rooms : root
RoomDoc *-- messages : includes
SessionDoc *-- sessions : root
rooms "1" -- "0..*" messages : holds >

note right of RoomDoc : members: transient,\nno table, kept in memory
note right of LobbyDoc : transient: no table,\nkept in memory
@enduml
